<title>PHILIPPINES: Globe posts 530 mln peso 9-mth net loss.</title>
<headline>Globe posts 530 mln peso 9-mth net loss.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Globe Telecom GMCR posted a net loss of 530 million pesos in the first nine months of the year, parent Ayala Corp said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;Globe recorded a nine-month loss of 530 million pesos although its financial condition remains strong as it gears up for the expansion of its services in the cellular and fixed line businesses,&quot; Ayala said in a statement.</p>
<p>No other details were immediately available.</p>
<p>Globe is a joint venture between Ayala and Singapore Telecom.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
</text>
